{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ZOMBIE RECALL</strong> is a development-in-progress started by a small team two years ago. Now we think the game is ready to be tried with real VR Players.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The [PRE-ALPHA: A] DEMO</strong> is a short game experience, that we release to have community feedback about the concept and the mechanics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE PLAN:</strong>\u00a0 To update the demo each week until we get a solid Early Access Version.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE GAME CONCEPT:</strong> A direct fast action shooter, with a fluid user experience, fun physics, variety of enemies and mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE ART:</strong> Located in a distopic future, with retro-futuristic vibes and techno-like music.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562980?t=1745438976","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562980/afacf849f9c0e0234d0bfbbfc6b8098775d9e9f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745438976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562980/31252781ce469f14421d5d810cb3f9dcb738ced8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745438976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562980/31252781ce469f14421d5d810cb3f9dcb738ced8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745438976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\"The game features physical violence with weapons against humanoid 'mutants' and machines. It also includes toon-style gore with a body dismemberment system. The player can die in a 'combat training simulator' within the game.\""},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ZOMBIE RECALL</strong> is a development-in-progress 